<title>UK: Bradford wool market report.</title>
<headline>Bradford wool market report.</headline>
<dateline>BRADFORD, England 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merino prices were firmer on the Bradford wool market reflecting higher prices being paid at origin sales, where the Japanese have been strong buyers, during early 1997, brokers said.</p>
<p>But there has been little new business reported so far despite a growing interest.</p>
<p>Deliveries were going out well and trade views were that buyers may be very reluctant to pay more but may have to in order to keep in touch with supplies.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
